WEBVTT

00:01:57.561 --> 00:02:00.910
to walk outside
of their front door every day

00:02:00.934 --> 00:02:04.952
to establish a lifesaving
habit of walking;

00:02:05.972 --> 00:02:09.384
in doing so, ignite a radical movement

00:02:09.408 --> 00:02:12.749
in which Black women reverse
the devastating impacts

00:02:12.773 --> 00:02:14.088
of chronic disease,

00:02:14.112 --> 00:02:16.413
reclaim the streets
of their neighborhoods,

00:02:16.437 --> 00:02:19.242
create a new culture
of health for their families

00:02:19.266 --> 00:02:21.975
and stand on the front lines for justice.

00:02:21.999 --> 00:02:25.078
Today, all across America,

00:02:25.102 --> 00:02:30.180
more than 100,000 Black women
are wearing this GirlTrek blue shirt